{
  "id": "颛顼",
  "name": "颛顼",
  "pinyin": "zhuān xū",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "deity",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "传说中古代部族首领，号高阳氏，生于若水，居于帝丘(今河南濮阳市西南)",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-08-12",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "传说中古代部族首领，号高阳氏，生于若水，居于帝丘(今河南濮阳市西南)"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-08-12",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "务隅之山，帝颛顼葬于阳，九嫔葬于阴。一曰爰有熊"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-12",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "汉水出鲋鱼之山，帝颛顼葬于阳，九嫔葬于阴，四蛇卫之。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "海之外大壑，少昊之国。少昊孺帝颛顼于此，弃其琴瑟。有甘山者，甘水"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-16-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有国名曰淑士，颛顼之子。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "荒之中，河水之间，附禺之山，帝颛顼与九嫔葬焉。爰有久、文贝、离俞"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有叔歜国，颛顼之子，黍食，使四鸟：虎、豹、熊"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "渠股、豚止，取淖子曰阿女，生帝颛顼。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "soushenji-01-05",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "五帝之一。相传是黄帝之孙，昌意之子，居帝邱(今河南省濮阳东南)，号高阳氏"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "soushenji-01-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "者，殷时大夫也。姓篯，名铿。帝颛顼之孙，陆终氏之中子。历夏而至商"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "soushenji-16-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "昔颛顼氏有三子，死而为疫鬼：一居江水"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "chuci-05-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "门。\n\n轶迅风于清源兮,\n\n从颛顼乎增冰。\n\n历玄冥以邪径兮,\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-04-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "星辰，地受水潦尘埃。昔者共工与颛顼争为帝，怒而触不周之山，天柱折"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-06-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "积冰、雪雹霜霰、漂润群水之野，颛顼、玄冥之所司者，万二千里。其令"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "笄，越人劗鬋，其于服，一也。帝颛顼之法，妇人不辟男子于路者，拂之"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-18-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "由来者远矣！黄帝尝与炎帝战矣，颛顼尝与共工争矣。故黄帝战于涿鹿之"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 8
  }
}
